Upstream-Name: openhamshack-nb
Source: https://openhamshack.com/source/
Comment: The complete source of every release of OpenHamShack QO-100 NB and
 OpenHamShack Radio, including rust/ohsdigi from which ohscore/ohsdigi.abi3.so is built, is
 published there as openhamshack-nb-<version>-src.tar.gz (section
 #openhamshack-nb) and openhamshack-radio-<version>-src.tar.gz
 (#openhamshack-radio), one tarball per version, for as long as that
 version is offered. Releases before 17/10/2026 are under their former
 names, openhamshack-nb and openhamshack-ham.

